# FV endpoint template. The endpoint is not static: it comes from the Servers
# response as svr + par.fv.p (PROTOCOL.md §Endpoint). Copy this file, replace the
# address and port with the values the daemon received, and pass the copy to
# capture.sh --filter-file.
#
# One complete clause per line; lines are OR-ed.
host 203.0.113.10 and tcp port 8443
